## 1. DEVICE IDENTIFICATION:
id: teensy-3-6
name: "PJRC Teensy 3.6 — MK66FX1M0VMD18 ARM Cortex-M4F 180MHz HW-FPU, 1MB Flash, 256KB RAM, 64 GPIO, USB-HS Host, 2xCAN, 4xI2C, SDIO"
manufacturer: "PJRC.COM LLC"
mcu: "NXP/Freescale MK66FX1M0VMD18 — ARM Cortex-M4F 180MHz (OC 240MHz); 32-bit HW-FPU; 32-DMA; 8KB cache; Crypto/RNG/CRC; ETH MAC"
category: maker
image: teensy-3-6.svg
url: "https://www.pjrc.com/store/teensy36.html"

